Maybe I'll get a chance to leave

3
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:04,450
if possible

4
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:07,050
Please pass on the unexpected information to the next person

5
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:08,050
Renren for me

6
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,250
I am Renren

7
